  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-03-26T23:07:31.705Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, if you're in an Invite+ world and someone is on Blue, any of their friends can automatically join on them.  Please make it so that people have to manually accept an invite for anyone to join, or make some kind of toggle to turn this on.  \nPeople are on our friend's list for all sorts of reasons and not all of them are going to be appropriate if you want to maintain a chill vibe, for instance.  It's frustrating when you just want to chill with some friends and friends of friends, but one of your friends is always on Blue and before you know it, everyone and your brother is in the instance and it's just chaos.",
